{"3924990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trash Bot", "steam_appid": 3924990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a time when you were a coveted video game console toy that redefined entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are <strong>TRASH.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape an underground that's as beautifully nostalgic as it is suffocating. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on, one last adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>originally a winner of the Inbound Shovel Jam 2025, extended with more puzzles, new abilities, secrets, and a fully fleshed out world and story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious World!</strong> Explore the whimsical, decaying ruins of 3 fictional N64-era platformer gems!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique 3D Puzzle Platformer Gameplay! </strong>Express your abilities through a one button - one use collectable cartridge system. Use these to solve spatial puzzles, and overcome fresh platforming challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Relics! </strong>Use abilities in creative ways to find secret areas and collect bygone treasure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy Instinctual Cravings!</strong> Roll around dirt as a little retro game-console robot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game You Can Finish In One Sitting!</strong> Trash Bot respects your time. A complete experience that can be finished in one sitting! <i>(depending on your proficiency with puzzle platformers)</i>. Completing all challenges and collecting all secrets will take much longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/extras/34e6659966e21bf6d94e39024660d089.avif?t=1754664173\" width=200 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was a time when you were a coveted video game console toy that redefined entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you are <strong>TRASH.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape an underground that's as beautifully nostalgic as it is suffocating. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on, one last adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>originally a winner of the Inbound Shovel Jam 2025, extended with more puzzles, new abilities, secrets, and a fully fleshed out world and story.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mysterious World!</strong> Explore the whimsical, decaying ruins of 3 fictional N64-era platformer gems!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique 3D Puzzle Platformer Gameplay! </strong>Express your abilities through a one button - one use collectable cartridge system. Use these to solve spatial puzzles, and overcome fresh platforming challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Relics! </strong>Use abilities in creative ways to find secret areas and collect bygone treasure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfy Instinctual Cravings!</strong> Roll around dirt as a little retro game-console robot!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Game You Can Finish In One Sitting!</strong> Trash Bot respects your time. A complete experience that can be finished in one sitting! <i>(depending on your proficiency with puzzle platformers)</i>. Completing all challenges and collecting all secrets will take much longer!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/extras/34e6659966e21bf6d94e39024660d089.avif?t=1754664173\" width=200 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Trash Bot is a one button 3D Puzzle Platformer. Collect forgotten abilities, Solve spatial puzzles, Find hidden relics, Resist the nostalgia and escape the Underground. All while making silly little robot noises.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/f207cee988a9bcd9a5d065f11424a153821e89e2/header.jpg?t=1754664173", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/aa4447a7fe92e27a359184c13b7295fcc7e71f07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754664173", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924990/aa4447a7fe92e27a359184c13b7295fcc7e71f07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754664173", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core intel or AMD 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> GeForce GTX 580</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jahju"], "publishers": ["Jahju"], "packa